extraction_notes: "Transcribed from Rifts World Book 3: England p.69-71, read off 170 dpi renders. The class is the six-year bond of servitude. The 10- and 14-year servitude tiers start at levels 3 and 5 and change the spell list and the starting level, which a variant cannot carry, so they are stored as prose special_abilities. The Random Insanity Table (printed p.69, in the Temporal Wizard''s entry) is a body section, Random Insanity Table. occ_group magic and men_of_arms false, from the book filing the class under the Temporal Magic heading. The every-other-level slot, one conventional spell of levels 1-4 OR one temporal spell, is stored as spell_levels 1-4 and 7-15 with spell_traditions_allowed temporal; a general (non-temporal) spell of levels 7-15 can leak into that slot, and the slot''s note says a 7-15 pick must be Temporal. Lesser protection circle, where the book names one, is held as Protection Circle: Simple. Temporal spell rows stand as the catalog holds them (newest printing wins, Nate 2026-10-04); no spell row was added or changed. Not stored: environmental body armor, the per-W.P. weapons, the energy pistol and rifle, the mini-oxygen tank and the neuro-mace (the vibro-knife alternative). The gems and precious metals are restrictions prose."
